  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut zucchini and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 15-20 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63db597f68fdd09c6d010edd/step-ecf1eca3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock, garlic seasoning and risoni. Bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63db597f68fdd09c6d010edd/step-e7461af4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and cook, stirring, until ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins.\n• Stir roasted veggies, baby spinach and the butter through risoni.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63db597f68fdd09c6d010edd/step-43aadee7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie risoni between bowls. Crumble over fetta.\n• Top with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63db597f68fdd09c6d010edd/step-1f9d587a.jpg"
    }
  ]
